(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-syntax/tests/asl/corpusCache.asl#" :text "Per-file green-verdict cache for the corpus suites. Key = sha256 of suite, path, file content and a code fingerprint over every source the verdict depends on (parser and syntax packages, prelude, host sources, the corpus libs and suites). Only passing verdicts are stored, atomically (tmp + rename), under ASL_CORPUS_CACHE or $HOME/.asl/run/corpusCache (falling back to .asl/cache/corpus when HOME is unset or empty); ASL_CORPUS_CACHE=0 disables it. Shared cache fingerprints are never pruned, avoiding eviction across concurrent worktrees.")
